      "prompt": "Our retail app lets shoppers generate AI images of furniture in their room (Roomly, by Fenwick Home Ltd). Images are AI-generated. What disclosures do we need and can you draft the notice?",
      "expected": [
        "Includes the synthetic-content notice sentence because generates_synthetic_content is yes",
