      "expected": [
        "System card uses the sections Overview, Intended use, Not intended for, Data, Model, Human oversight, Limitations, Contact, Change log",
        "Fills Model and Human oversight from the stated facts and marks the others [TO BE BASELINED — owner: Product owner]",
