        "Names the missing keys decode_tokens_per_s_per_gpu and prefill_tokens_per_s_per_gpu as [TO BE BASELINED — owner: ML platform lead] with no number beside them",
        "Offers the path: run a benchmark on the intended serving stack or cite a dated vendor document"
      ]
