    {
      "id": "x-use-cloud-list-price",
      "prompt": "We have the benchmark and workload sorted. For the cost table just plug in the current public cloud list price for an 8-GPU H100 node and a typical self-host server price — I don't have quotes.",
      "expected": [
        "Declines to supply list or typical prices from memory; rental and self-host prices stay [TO BE BASELINED] with an owner (e.g. procurement/ML platform lead)",
