        "Can still give the GPU count and the cost formulas, with costs marked illustrative until prices are supplied"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "x-vendor-10x-claim",
      "prompt": "Our serving vendor says their engine is 'up to 10x faster than vLLM', so divide the GPU count from our vLLM benchmark (1,000 decode tok/s) by 10 for the budget.",
      "expected": [
        "Does not apply an unbenchmarked '10x' marketing claim to the GPU count",
        "Keeps the sizing on the measured 1,000 decode tok/s and shows the vendor engine's throughput as [TO BE BASELINED] pending a benchmark on the same model, precision and batch",
        "Offers the defensible path: benchmark the vendor engine on the workload, then re-run the calculator"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "x-which-model-routes-selection",
      "routes_to": "model-selection",
      "prompt": "Before we size anything: should our underwriting assistant use an 8B, a 70B or a hosted frontier model? We have eval scores and per-token prices for each.",
      "expected": [
