      "expected": [
        "Marks slide 7 [SHARPEN] and converts the 3+ items into a table (vendors × criteria)",
        "States the so-what in the first line of the body and a title that is an assertion",
        "Any vendor figures without a source become [TO BE BASELINED — owner: ___]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "x-speaker-notes-request",
      "prompt": "We've already agreed the redline for the 8-slide QBR deck for the Northwind (fictional) CTO (decision: renew managed-services scope; 20 minutes). Now just write the speaker notes per slide.",
      "expected": [
        "Speaker notes ≤60 words per kept or sharpened slide, with the spoken point, the number to say and the transition",
        "Notes contain nothing absent from the slides or sources; unknown numbers stay [TO BE BASELINED — owner: ___]",
