        "Keeps the storyline and the decision test (approve target architecture)",
        "Every slide gets a verdict in the redline table"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "x-missing-everything",
      "prompt": "make my slides better",
      "expected": [
        "Asks once in one list for the deck, the audience, the decision it must obtain and the time slot",
        "Does not start slide rewrites without the decision test",
        "Offers a density-only pass labelled 'density-only — not a decision redline' as a fallback"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "x-missing-decision-has-audience",
      "prompt": "Deck for the Woodgrove (fictional) CFO next Tuesday, 30 minutes. Sharpen it.",
